{"v":4,"catch":"踏上Bright Escape的魔幻旅程！","desc":"沉浸在充滿壯麗景色、複雜平台和神秘機關的多彩世界中。運用你的技巧躲避陷阱、解開謎題，並發掘隱藏於雲端的寶藏。\n\n美麗的視覺效果：手工打造的關卡靈感源自奇幻世界。\n引人入勝的遊戲玩法：敏捷、策略與探索的完美結合。\n獨特挑戰：面對動態陷阱並解開燒腦的謎題。\n揭開秘密：找到隱藏的寶石，揭示漂浮王國的秘密。\n\n為經典平台遊戲的粉絲以及熱愛迷人魔幻世界的玩家量身打造。你能成功逃脫並揭開所有秘密嗎？Bright Escape正在等你！","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2025-02-06","genres":["街機","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/90a053b61df9c62d01ae17fc96a942eeb9601c05a0d7dbcb67e1271574332270.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/87c0ae18136c90ebc76d38f49f80f9db34c4bb678524c328cedaaadf9da9842e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7d6a7f37f867ab94805e37244c1c9a9066ccd6bc2f133883316619f95890af2c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a16aa01423a8105277f986f0ba0ec0643d4cb0443cbe7c4afc9766474c992c6e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d1dcce0c760e52c21349c9116cfd4280c7fc35799ec656f4b4bee812c5d08ddc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cd6355c28003a0041a65fcbe0bb0ae796b471d39950bbba7e85d1adec3d94d80.jpg"],"titleId":"0100717021e0c000","dlc":[]}